        "description": "Electro Swing Pack Volume 2: Electric Boogaloo!\n\nFor the anniversary of my first pack, I am making a sequel.\n10 Electro Swing songs, 3 difficulties each + custom vanilla lights!\n\nGet the pack here:\nhttps://bsaber.com/electro-swing-pack-2/\nhttps://beatsaver.com/playlists/6572\n\nPreview this map:\nhttps://youtu.be/EwxkfJLd21U\n\nPack Preview Playlist:\nhttps://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLrVm0whzsGKL5NYTUIEzDyITjl6WuLSJ4\n\n\nThank you to all the Playtesters!\nAlice, MaybeeMae, Pixelguy, Raaknys, Namaki Mono, DeeDee, and WolfieBeat ❤️\n\n\nMore Maps: https://beatsaver.com/profile/4286374\nDiscord: Nixie.Korten#6944\nJoin My Server: https://discord.gg/RjxPpZtH7w\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/Nixie_Korten\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/nixie.korten/",
