        "description": "was intended to be nominated for beasties 2024 basic chroma lightshow of the year...\n*unfortunately* we didn't know it would be ineligible for nomination since it wasn't released in time. oh well\nthanks to @Tsunami_Pro for cooking the lightshow up in any case, i really like it!\n\nchroma lights preview:\nhttps://youtu.be/Bo0rOCXxk3Q\n\npretty simple dance map, or as close as my style gets to dance, anyway. the lights are the real thing to see here methinks. and the song, the song slaps. in any case, hope ya'll like!\n\nreup #1: removed an arc",
