        "description": "23.12.25 update - added missing lights on all diffs except Ex+. Sorry ;_; \nGreetings.\nAnd here we are again. Flying across the sky, dropping another banger to your Beat Saver doorstep ^_-. I didn't watch 2nd season of Wednesday (Najoko did), but when I heard this banger, there was only one thought in head. THIS WILL BE MAPPED!\n\nCollab credits\n@Najoko - Expert+ mapper;\n@spartplat and @Najoko - team-mapping of Easy-Expert diffs;\n@Najoko - Lighter;\n\nBig Thanks to @Noveliniel for testplaying our map and helping during editing process.\n\nAnd thanks to YOU, for playing our map. Have a nice day ^_^.\n\nOG track\nhttps://youtu.be/vO90xyq19Wg\n\nExpert+ preview\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TGuAgVJEf14",
